      "description": "Watch GO Ahead Eagles vs ADO Den Haag highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 23, 2026. The atmosphere was electric as Go Ahead Eagles hosted ADO Den Haag in this Eredivisie showdown on August 23, 2026. Both teams entered the pitch looking to assert their dominance in a match that promised tactical intrigue and high energy. Tengstedt Breaks the Deadlock The contest began with both sides testing the waters, though Go Ahead Eagles looked the more composed in possession. The breakthrough finally arrived in the 38th minute when Alfons Sampsted delivered a precise ball that found Soeren Tengstedt . With a clinical left-footed finish, Tengstedt sent the home crowd into raptures, giving his side a vital 1-0 lead. Despite ADO Den Haag 's efforts to respond before the interval, including a blocked header by Evan Rottier , the hosts held their advantage going into the break. Second Half Drama and the ADO Fightback The intensity ramped up in the second half as Go Ahead Eagles sought to double their lead, which they achieved in the 64th minute. Soeren Tengstedt turned provider this time, setting up Victor Edvardsen for a composed right-footed finish to make it 2-0. However, ADO Den Haag refused to go down without a fight. In the 78th minute, Milan Hokke found Evan Rottier , who clinicaly found the net to reduce the deficit and set up a grandstand finish. Sigurdarson Seals the Points As the clock ticked down, the match became physical, with Evan Rottier and Juho Kilo both seeing yellow cards as the visitors pushed for an equalizer. Any hopes of a comeback were extinguished in the 91st minute. Dean James delivered a quality cross that was met by Stefan Ingi Sigurdarson , whose powerful header flew into the net. With the score settled at 3-1 in front of 9,524 spectators, Go Ahead Eagles celebrated a deserved victory after a fine display of clinical finishing and late-game composure."
